@startuml
title SplitSmart - Proposed Domain Relationships

class User
class Group
class GroupMembership <<inferred>>
class Expense
class SplitAllocation <<inferred>>
class ApprovalDecision
class Obligation <<inferred>>
class Payment
class Balance <<derived>>
class ReportQuery
class ReportResult

Group "1" -- "1..*" GroupMembership
User "1" -- "0..*" GroupMembership
Group "1" -- "0..*" Expense
User "1" -- "0..*" Expense : payer
Expense "1" -- "0..*" SplitAllocation
SplitAllocation "*" --> "1" User : participant
Expense "1" -- "0..*" ApprovalDecision
User "1" -- "0..*" ApprovalDecision : approver
Expense "1" -- "0..*" Obligation : approved allocations
Obligation "*" --> "1" User : debtor
Obligation "*" --> "1" User : creditor
Obligation "0..*" -- "0..*" Payment : settled by
Balance ..> Obligation : derived from
Balance ..> Payment : reduced by
ReportQuery ..> ReportResult : produces
ReportResult ..> Expense
ReportResult ..> Payment
ReportResult ..> Balance

note right of Expense
  Pending expenses do not create
  obligations or change balances.
  Amount is BigDecimal and > 0.
  Empty participant behavior is open.
end note
note bottom of SplitAllocation
  Percentage totals must equal 100%.
  Monetary scale and remainder policy
  remain unresolved.
end note
note bottom of Balance
  BigDecimal projection; currency,
  grouping/netting policy unresolved.
end note
note right of Payment
  Allocation to one or multiple
  obligations is unresolved.
end note
@enduml
